        out_string("This is my escape, I'm running through this world And I'm not looking back And I know I can go where no one's ever gone And I'm not looking back But how will I know when I get there? And how will I know when to leave? We've all gotta start from somewhere, and it's right there for me The possibilities are never-ending I see it, I see it, and now it's all within my reach Endless possibility I see it, I see it now; it's always been inside of me And now I feel so free, endless possibility And so I'll carry on; my time to shine has come I feel it! As fast as I can go, straight to the top, I know You'll see it! So please wake me up when I get there It feels like I'm lost in a dream I know in my heart that it's my time, and I already see The possibilities are never-ending I see it, I see it, and now it's all within my reach Endless possibility I see it, I see it now; it's always been inside of me And now I feel so free, endless possibility")
